it is wholly within 12&quot; of any friendly **^^Slaves to Darkness Heroes^^**, add 1 to the Attacks characteristic of this unit's melee weapons for the rest of the turn.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Red</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Offensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile></profiles><selections><selection id="brr9s2a" name="Spire Tyrant" entryId="3798-a94f-c3c2-a847::0e43-33be-9b96-16d4" number="1" type="model" from="entry"><selections><selection id="bstz198" name="Gladiator Weapons" entryId="3798-a94f-c3c2-a847::a381-f52e-b8f9-55a5" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="1713-013c-c489-b820" name="Gladiator Weapons" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">Anti-**^^Hero^^** (+1 Rend)</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection><selection id="bsh1gcw" name="Champion" entryId="3798-a94f-c3c2-a847::bd3e-0978-d91f-57f1::9c21-1746-9873-a5b5" entryGroupId="3798-a94f-c3c2-a847::ee96-99fb-17de-9b3f" number="1" type="upgrade" from="group" group="Command Models"><profiles><profile id="cfed-845b-b46c-fc6d" name="Champion" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">Add 1 to the Attacks characteristic of weapons used by champions in this unit. If this unit is a **^^Beast^^**, this ability affects this unit's **Companion** weapons.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Red</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Offensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile></profiles><categories><category id="9c77-5e0b-a20f-d885" name="Command Model" entryId="9c77-5e0b-a20f-d885" primary="false" /></categories></selection></selections></selection><selection id="btf97qq" name="Spire Tyrant" entryId="3798-a94f-c3c2-a847::0e43-33be-9b96-16d4" number="8" type="model" from="entry"><selections><selection id="bt5mecw" name="Gladiator Weapons" entryId="3798-a94f-c3c2-a847::a381-f52e-b8f9-55a5" number="8" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="1713-013c-c489-b820" name="Gladiator Weapons" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">Anti-**^^Hero^^** (+1 Rend)</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection></selections></selection></selections><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="110" /></costs><categories><category id="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" name="CHAOS" entryId="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" primary="false" /><category id="94d9-cc36-9083-1bea" name="SLAVES TO DARKNESS" entryId="94d9-cc36-9083-1bea" primary="false" /><category id="75d6-6995-dfcc-3898" entryId="75d6-6995-dfcc-3898" name="INFANTRY" primary="true" /><category id="9ff6-420e-8f6d-f6dd" name="UNDIVIDED" entryId="9ff6-420e-8f6d-f6dd" primary="false" /><category id="acaf-8bb6-d6f-3e2a" name="Legends" entryId="acaf-8bb6-d6f-3e2a" primary="false" /><category id="c2cc-3b24-96e3-4245" name="CHAMPION (1/9)" entryId="c2cc-3b24-96e3-4245" primary="false" /></categories></selection><selection id="cgaqjei" name="Splintered Fang" entryId="d82a-95d9-b777-37e1::78f8-9ac5-641f-8b5c" number="1" type="unit" from="entry"><rules><rule id="ae6e-3f8c-0e29-150d" name="Splintered Fang" hidden="false"><description>*This unit's Serpents are a token. There is 1 Serpents token for every 9 models in this unit.*</description></rule></rules><profiles><profile id="94dd-9f97-cbdd-f04e" name="Splintered Fang" hidden="false" typeId="ff03-376e-972f-8ab2" typeName="Unit" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Move" typeId="fed0-d1b3-1bb8-c501">6&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Health" typeId="96be-54ae-ce7b-10b7">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Save" typeId="1981-ef09-96f6-7aa9">5+</characteristic><characteristic name="Control" typeId="6c6f-8510-9ce1-fc6e">1</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="9fda-b0eb-1410-5760" name="Slithering Serpents" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">End of Any Turn</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">If this unit's **Serpents** are on the battlefield, pick an enemy unit in combat with this unit to be the target.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Roll a D3. On a 1, remove this unit's **Serpents** from the battlefield. On a 2+, inflict an amount of mortal damage on the target equal to the roll.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Purple</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Offensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="3afc-9217-ec2f-15c0" name="Paralysing Strikes" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">Each time this unit uses a **^^Fight^^** ability, if its attacks score 2 or more critical hits against the same enemy unit, that unit has **^^Strike-last^^** for the rest of the turn.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Red</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile></profiles><selections><selection id="cik7hs" name="Splintered Fang" entryId="d82a-95d9-b777-37e1::3802-57e2-4ea9-8349" number="1" type="model" from="entry"><selections><selection id="cir77p6" name="Poisoned Weapons" entryId="d82a-95d9-b777-37e1::1e32-3c36-2528-58ba" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="63e9-ec1e-f1f5-465f" name="Poisoned Weapons" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">Crit (Mortal)</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection><selection id="ciyj0i" name="Champi